# Optional: copy as switch/gtav-scripthook/runtime.ini on your SD card.
# Restart GTA after editing. Remove a key to use the runtime build's default.
# Standard defaults: 8 resident NROs, 16 script slots, 8 MiB plugin budget.
# Standard ranges: resident_limit 1-16; script_slots 1-32; plugin_memory_mib 1-64.
# Uncomment only the settings you want to override:
# resident_limit=8
# script_slots=16
# plugin_memory_mib=8
